# Pairs with DedupNeverDropsNew. The causal buffer displaces an entry to the
# dead-letter queue without releasing its identity-cache reservation, which
# ParkAsync does release. The replay is then dropped as a duplicate of a
# write that was never applied.
MODULE: DedupNeverDropsNewEvictionKeepsReservation
TARGET: DedupNeverDropsNew
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an evicted buffered entry keeps its identity reservation, so its replay is dropped as a duplicate
PERTURBS: Evict

--- FIND
    /\ cache' = [cache EXCEPT ![x] = @ \ {Ident(w)}]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the displaced entry's reservation is kept.
    /\ cache' = cache
--- END
